From b1c377c9ef1b3599ed381659fdcd4ca7c790de31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Jun 2025 07:14:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Implement cost calculation feature with Cost tab
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Add cost calculation methods for drugs, IV fluids, and remarks
- Add new Cost tab to bottom right panel showing itemized costs
- Support continuous drug duration-based calculations
- Support remarks event duration-based calculations
- Update CSV files with cost information (unit, price_per_unit columns)
- Real-time cost updates when new entries are added

Cost calculation logic:
- Drugs: (dose ÷ cost_unit rounded up) × price_per_unit
- Continuous drugs: (dose_per_minute × duration_minutes ÷ cost_unit rounded up) × price_per_unit
- IV Fluids: (volume ÷ unit rounded up) × price_per_unit
- Remarks: (duration_minutes ÷ unit rounded up) × price_per_unit

Tested with sample data showing correct calculations:
- ミダゾラム 5mg = ¥11.5
- 生理食塩水 500ml = ¥750
- 麻酔開始 2hrs = ¥6,000
- Total: ¥6,761.5

Co-Authored-By: Tatsuki Onishi <bougtoir@gmail.com>
